* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary

# The approved design packs are byte-exact authorities: their SHA-256 is the
# authority, so git must never normalise them (src/ui/design-authority.test.ts).
# The four canonical anatomy packs, and the current visual comparison
# references beside them, are both hashed records.
docs/design/approved/*.html -text
docs/design/approved/anatomy/*.html -text
docs/design/approved/reference/*.html -text
docs/design/approved/reference/*.svg -text

# The production Threshold master is a byte-for-byte copy of the approved
# reference master, and docs/brand/brand-manifest.json records that SHA-256.
src/brand/logo/iamai-threshold-master.svg -text
